#: _PayorParticipationFunction@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Set of codes indicating the manner in which payors participate in a policy or program.</"
msgstr ""

# null
#: CLMADJ
msgid "claims adjudication"
msgstr ""

# null
#: CLMADJ@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Manages all operations required to adjudicate fee for service claims or managed care encounter reports."
msgstr ""

# null
#: ENROLL
msgid "enrollment broker"
msgstr ""

# null
#: ENROLL@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Managing the enrollment of covered parties."
msgstr ""

# null
#: FFSMGT
msgid "ffs management"
msgstr ""

# null
#: FFSMGT@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Managing all operations required to administer a fee for service or indemnity health plan including enrolling covered parties and providing customer service, provider contracting, claims payment, care management and utilization review."
msgstr ""

# null
#: MCMGT
msgid "managed care management"
msgstr ""

# null
#: MCMGT@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Managing all operations required to administer a managed care plan including enrolling covered parties and providing customer service,, provider contracting, claims payment, care management and utilization review."
msgstr ""

# null
#: PROVMGT
msgid "provider management"
msgstr ""

# null
#: PROVMGT@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Managing provider contracting, provider services, credentialing, profiling, performance measures, and ensuring network adequacy."
msgstr ""

# null
#: UMGT
msgid "utilization management"
msgstr ""

# null
#: UMGT@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Managing utilization of services by ensuring that providers adhere to, e.g., payeraTMs clinical protocols for medical appropriateness and standards of medical necessity. May include management of authorizations for services and referrals."
msgstr ""

# null
#: _SponsorParticipationFunction
msgid "SponsorParticipationFunction"
msgstr ""

# null
#: _SponsorParticipationFunction@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Set of codes indicating the manner in which sponsors participate in a policy or program. NOTE: use only when the Sponsor is not further specified with a SponsorRoleType as being either a fully insured sponsor or a self insured sponsor."
msgstr ""

# null
#: FULINRD
msgid "fully insured"
msgstr ""

# null
#: FULINRD@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Responsibility taken by a sponsor to contract with one or more underwriters for the assumption of full responsibility for the risk and administration of a policy or program."
msgstr ""

# null
#: SELFINRD
msgid "self insured"
msgstr ""

# null
#: SELFINRD@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Responsibility taken by a sponsor to organize the underwriting of risk and administration of a policy or program."
msgstr ""

# null
#: _UnderwriterParticipationFunction
msgid "UnderwriterParticipationFunction"
msgstr ""

# null
#: _UnderwriterParticipationFunction@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Set of codes indicating the manner in which underwriters participate in a policy or program."
msgstr ""

# null
#: PAYORCNTR
msgid "payor contracting"
msgstr ""

# null
#: PAYORCNTR@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Contracting for the provision and administration of health services to payors while retaining the risk for coverage. Contracting may be for all provision and administration; or for provision of certain types of services; for provision of services by region; and by types of administration, e.g., claims adjudication, enrollment, provider management, and utilization management. Typically done by underwriters for sponsors who need coverage provided to covered parties in multiple regions. The underwriter may act as the payor in some, but not all of the regions in which coverage is provided."
msgstr ""

# null
#: REINS
msgid "reinsures"
msgstr ""

# null
#: REINS@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Underwriting reinsurance for another underwriter for the policy or program."
msgstr ""

# null
#: RETROCES
msgid "retrocessionaires"
msgstr ""

# null
#: RETROCES@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Underwriting reinsurance for another reinsurer."
msgstr ""

# null
#: SUBCTRT
msgid "subcontracting risk"
msgstr ""

# null
#: SUBCTRT@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Delegating risk for a policy or program to one or more subcontracting underwriters, e.g., a major health insurer may delegate risk for provision of coverage under a national health plan to other underwriters by region ."
msgstr ""

# null
#: UNDERWRTNG
msgid "underwriting"
msgstr ""

# null
#: UNDERWRTNG@definition
msgid "**Definition:** Provision of underwriting analysis for another underwriter without assumption of risk."
msgstr ""

# null
#: ADMPHYS
msgid "admitting physician"
msgstr "Responsable de l'admission"

# null
#: ADMPHYS@definition
msgid "A physician who admitted a patient to a hospital or other care unit that is the context of this service."
msgstr ""

# null
#: ANEST
msgid "anesthesist"
msgstr ""

# null
#: ANEST@definition
msgid "In a typical anesthesia setting an anesthesiologist or anesthesia resident in charge of the anesthesia and life support, but only a witness to the surgical procedure itself. To clarify responsibilities anesthesia should always be represented as a separate service related to the surgery."
msgstr ""

# null
#: ANRS
msgid "anesthesia nurse"
msgstr ""

# null
#: ANRS@definition
msgid "In a typical anesthesia setting the nurse principally assisting the anesthesiologist during the critical periods."
msgstr ""

